 serve as a perfect getaway after a tiring day at work, as DSD Aura will make you forget that you are living in the heart of the city. These residential apartments in Borivali offer luxurious homes that amazingly escape the noise of the city center. In addition to that, there are several benefits of living in apartments with good locality. DSD Aura is conveniently located at Borivali to provide unmatched connectivity from all the important landmarks and places of everyday utility such as various well-known hospitals, educational institutions, super-marts, parks, entertainment spots, recreational centers, and so on.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2024\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹32,000/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n851 - 1971 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Greenery and plantations throughout the ground floor.\n* Double height air conditioned grand entrance lobby.\n* Gym room fitted with state of the art equipment's.\n\n* Rooftop infinity swimming pool with loungers.\n* CCTV and intercom system connected to security cabin/reception.\n* Spacious, open and airy lavish apartments.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/jacuzzi-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jacuzzi-secondary.svg)\n\nJacuzzi\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-secondary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-primary](/assets/i