|\n\nProperty ID :  NHI-90822-property\n\nBedrooms \n\n2,3,4\n\nBathrooms \n\n2,3,4\n\nGarage \n\n2,3,4\n\nYear Built \n\nDec 2024\n\nArea \n\n899 - 1515 sq ft\n\nVerified \n\n1\n\nNearby Schools \n\nRyan International School ORCHIDS The International School Smt. J. B. Khot High School Sheth Gopalji Hemraj High School\n\nNear by Healthcare providers \n\nAshwini Ayurvedic Hopsital Apex Hospital Mangal Murti Hospital Phoenix Hospital\n\n#### Description\n\nDSD Aura, developed by the esteemed DSD Group, stands as a beacon of luxury and exclusivity in Western Mumbai’s real estate landscape. Designed to offer a harmonious blend of elegance and comfort, this residential project promises a lifestyle of unparalleled sophistication.\n\nBoasting designer residences, DSD Aura ensures that its owners experience the epitome of comfort and well-being. Every aspect of this project is meticulously crafted to cater to the discerning tastes of its residents. From state-of-the-art amenities to breathtaking views, each home in DSD Aura is a sanctuary, providing a tranquil retreat from the hustle and bustle of city life.\n\nWhatever the BHK count in Aura, the offerings are luxurious, spacious, open, airy, and inviting. Whether you choose a 2 BHK, a 3 BHK, or a 4 BHK, depending on the size of your family or the size of the space you feel you deserve, you will not find it coming short with respect to any of the above natural luxuries.\n\n#### Additional Details\n\n* RERA Registration Number: P51800026945\n* Possession Date: Dec 2024\n* Area: 0.38 acres\n* Floors: G + 21 Floors\n* Per sq. ft.: ₹36, 600\n\n#### Features\n\n* [24/7 Security](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/24-7-security/)\n* [24/7 Water Supply](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/24-7-water-supply/)\n* [Central Lawn](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/central-lawn/)\n* [Club House](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/club-house/)\n* [Community Lawn](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/community-lawn/)\n* [Cycle Parking](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/cycle-parking/)\n* [Fire Fighting System](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/fire-fighting-system/)\n* [Games Room​](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/gamesroom/)\n* [Guest Rooms](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/guest-rooms/)\n* [Gym](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/gym/)\n* [Indoor Games Zone](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/indoor-games-zone/)\n* [Kids Play Area](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/kidsplayarea/)\n* [Lawn](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/lawn/)\n* [Parking (Covered/Uncovered)](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/parking-covered-uncovered/)\n* [Play Area](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/play-area/)\n* [Senior Citizens Lawn/ Park](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/senior-citizens-lawn-park/)\n* [Swimming Pool](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/swimming-pool/)\n* [Toddler's Play Area](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/toddlers-play-area/)\n* [Visitors Parking](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/visitors-parking/)\n* [Walking/Jogging Track](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/walking-jogging-track/)\n* [Yoga/Meditation/Aerobics Halls](https://newhomeinfo.in/property-feature/yoga-meditation-aerobics-halls/)\n\n### Site/Floor Plans\n\n[Typical Floor Plan](#)[2 BHK](#)[3 BHK](#)[4 BHK](#)\n\n#### Typical Floor Plan\n\n[![Typical Floor Plan](data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E)](https://newhomeinfo.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Screenshot-2025-10-14-145909.png)\n\n#### 2 BHK\n\nBedrooms\n\n2\n\nBathrooms\n\n2\n\nSize\n\n899 sq ft\n\n[![2 BHK](data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E)](https://newhomeinfo.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/26110323/2_BHK-1.png)\n\n#### 3 BHK\n\nBedrooms\n\n3\n\nBathrooms\n\n3\n\nSize\n\n1196 - 1309 sq ft\n\n[![3 BHK](data:image/svg