illas-cpt7c1)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/ready-to-move-cps4c1)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/plots-cpt6c1)\n  + [DSD infrastructure Properties for Sale In Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/dsd-infrastructure-in-mumbai-cdp13295i1)\n/* [Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-west-mumbai-l1493) \n  + [Properties For Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-west-mumbai-l1493)\n  + [Apartments Flats Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/apartments-lpt5l1493)\n  + [House/Villas for sale in Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/villas-lpt7l1493)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/ready-to-move-lps4l1493)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/plots-lpt6l1493)\n/* DSD Aura\n\n## DSD Aura\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-west-mumbai-l1493) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: DSD infrastructure](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-dsd-infrastructure-d13295)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Shimpoli, Borivali, Mumbai, Maharashtra.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 2.63 Cr to 4.38 Cr\\*\n\n![DSD Aura](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/70946/1676272631_Aura-Night-View-DSD-Group-854x1024_(1).jpg \"DSD Aura\")\n\n# DSD Aura in Borivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![DSD Aura](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/70946/1676272631_Aura-Night-View-DSD-Group-854x1024_(1).jpg \"DSD Aura\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 ,3 ,4 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 847 sqft - 1075 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 101 Units & 1 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0.38 Acres\n* Possession: June, 2024\n* Rera: P51800026945\n\n## About\n\nDsd Aura is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 0.38 Acres, the project features 101 Units in 1 Towers, offering a mix of 2 BHK+2T, to 4 BHK+4T Apartments ranging from 847 sqft to 1075 sqft. The address for the project is shimpoli, borivali, mumbai, maharashtra..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Dsd Aura are available in a variety of sizes. The 2 BHK+2T units start at 847 sqft. The larger 4 BHK+4T Apartments go up to 1075 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Dsd Aura are designed to be accessible, with 2 BHK+2T units priced from 2.63 Cr and 4 BHK+4T Apartments from 4.38 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by DSD infrastructure, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800026945 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2024-06-12, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nDsd Aura is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 0.38 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 101 Units, 1 Towers\n* Sizes: 847 sqft to 1075 sqft\n* Project Address: shimpoli, borivali, mumbai, maharashtra.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: DSD infrastructure\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800026945 Units\n* Possession Start: 2024-06-12\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nDsd Aura benefits from its location in Borivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Dsd Aura will begin in 2024-06-12, and the project is RERA registered under P51800026945 Units. Developed by DSD infrastructure, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of DSD Aura\n\n![DSD Aura Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"DSD Aura Floor Plan 847 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (847 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 2.1 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Availab