ivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Aura By DSD](https://huntvastuhomes.com/img/project/logo/aura_by_dsd_project_logo.jpg)\n\n✦ World's First Platform\n\n## Check Vastu of *Any Flat* in This Society Instantly\n\nFind your tower -.- Look for Unit Number -.- Check Vastu\n\nAura By DSD, a high-rise society located in Borivali West of Mumbai. This residential project is a Ready To Move society. Aura By DSD is a RERA registered project with the following RERA numbers for different phases - Phase 1: P51800026945. Aura By DSD is spread across 0.38 acres of land. It has 1 tower and total of 92 units. This society has apartments in 2BHK, 3BHK and 4BHK configurations. Aura By DSD has 5 types of Vastu compliant apartments that meets the criteria set by Hunt Vastu Homes. It makes it a total possibility of 59 Vastu compliant apartments that follow better Vastu principles than the other apartment in the society. 2BHK, 3BHK, 4BHK flats are in the range of ₹3.19 cr - ₹7.50 cr. Aura By DSD has been designed keeping the modern urbane sensibilities in mind and as such boasts a host of world-class amenities. Here’s a sneak-peek into the amenities that not only add great value to the property but to the lifestyle of the residents too: 24x7 Water Supply, Car Parking, CCTV Camera, Club House, Entrance Foyer, Fire Fighting System, Garbage Disposal, Garden and Gazebo.\n\nRead More\n\n[![Aura By DSD](https://i.imhvh.com/asset/img/project/aura_by_dsd_1.webp)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[![Aura By DSD](https://i.imhvh.com/asset/img/project/aura_by_dsd_2.webp)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[View photos](javascript:void(0);)\n\nCompletion Year\n\n### 2024\n\nConstruction Status\n\n### Ready To Move\n\nPrice Range\n\n### ₹3.19 cr - ₹7.50 cr\n\n### [DSD Group](https://huntvastuhomes.com/dsd-group-builder-vastu-projects)\n\n## To View Vastu Details Select Tower & Unit\n\n[### tower a](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### Unit 1\n\n4BHK+4Toilet (Carpet Area:1515 sqft)\n\nFloors: All Floors\n\nFlat numbers: 101, 201, 301, 401, etc.\n\n### Unit 2\n\n3BHK+3Toilet (Carpet Area:1217 sqft)\n\nFloors: 1-9, 11, 19\n\nFlat numbers: 102, 202, 302, 402, etc.\n\n### Unit 2\n\n4BHK+4Toilet (Carpet Area:1612 sqft)\n\nFloors: 13\n\nFlat numbers: 102, 202, 302, 402, etc.\n\n### Unit 2\n\n4BHK+4Toilet (Carpet Area:1790 sqft)\n\nFloors: 10, 12, 14-16, 18, 20-21\n\nFlat numbers: 102, 202, 302, 402, etc.\n\n### Unit 2\n\n5BHK+5Toilet (Carpet Area:2000 sqft)\n\nFloors: 17\n\nFlat numbers: 102, 202, 302, 402, etc.\n\n### Unit 3\n\n2BHK+2Toilet (Carpet Area:851 sqft)\n\nFloors: 11, 19\n\nFlat numbers: 103, 203, 303, 403, etc.\n\n### Unit 3\n\n2BHK+2Toilet (Carpet Area:899 sqft)\n\nFloors: 1-9\n\nFlat numbers: 103, 203, 303, 403, etc.\n\n### Unit 3\n\n3BHK+3Toilet (Carpet Area:1309 sqft)\n\nFloors: 1-5, 7-12, 14-21\n\nFlat numbers: 103, 203, 303, 403, etc.\n\n### Unit 4\n\n3BHK+3Toilet (Carpet Area:1196 sqft)\n\nFloors: 1-5, 7-9, 11, 17, 19\n\nFlat numbers: 104, 204, 304, 404, etc.\n\n### Unit 4\n\n4BHK+4Toilet (Carpet Area:1298 sqft)\n\nFloors: 10, 12, 14-16, 18, 20-21\n\nFlat numbers: 104, 204, 304, 404, etc.\n\n### Unit 5\n\n3BHK+3Toilet (Carpet Area:1309 sqft)\n\nFloors: 1-5, 7-21\n\nFlat numbers: 105, 205, 305, 405, etc.\n\n[All floor plans of Aura By DSD](/floorplans/aura-by-dsd-borivali-west-mumbai-floor-plans-2040)\n\n## Aura By DSD Site Plan\n\n![Aura By DSD](https://huntvastuhomes.com/img/project/sitePlanImages/aura_by_dsd_siteplan.webp)\n\n## Top Amenities & Facilities at Aura By DSD\n\n![24x7 Water Supply](https://huntvastuhomes.com/assets/img/logo-r.webp?v=1)\n\n24x7 Water Supply\n\n![Car Parking](https://huntvastuhomes.com/assets/img/logo-r.webp?v=1)\n\nCar Parking\n\n![CCTV Camera](https://huntvastuhomes.com/assets/img/logo-r.webp?v=1)\n\nCCTV Camera\n\n![Club House](https://huntvastuhomes.com/assets/img/logo-r.webp?v=1)\n\nClub House\n\n![Entrance Foyer](https://huntvastuhomes.com/assets/img/logo-r.webp?v=1)\n\nEntrance Foyer\n\n![Fire Fighting System](https://huntvastuhomes.com/assets/img/logo-r